exports[`llms-full.txt export > concatenates info, pages, workflows and operations with separators 1`] = `
"# Petstore

> Version 2.0.0 — OpenAPI 3.1.0

Base URL: https://api.example.com/v1

A sample API.

Manage your pets.

---

# Page: Guides

# Getting started

Read this first.

